id: ops-publish-indirection
title: Reject unresolved alias and function publish indirection in canonical attestation auditor
description: "Canonical repair for GitHub issue #149. Real shell aliases, forwarding functions and variable-routed xargs can execute unattested publishes while a sanctioned sibling satisfies non-vacuity. Companion owner: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-10T02:41:49.896Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-10T03:57:28.939Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Real subprocess adversarial fixtures and independent revert proofs; reject unresolved executable indirection; preserve sanctioned workflow; full release and packed npm/Bun checks.
repro_steps: Execute test/publish-indirection.test.ts against the prior attestation implementation; Bash/xargs inert publisher records show hidden publish calls behind an attested sibling.
expected_result: Every unresolved executable publisher path is refused; direct sanctioned provenance workflows and provable bindings remain accepted.
actual_result: "Repaired canonical auditor refuses unresolved alias, executable, forwarding and spawning paths; 26 corpus tests and 128 focused attestation tests pass. Reverting only the original auditor fails 18 corpus cases. Full release gate and packed npm/Bun consumers pass with documented pre-existing limits."
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-10T02:42:14.991Z",codex-sol,"Owner search found historical scalar/spawning-wrapper repairs but no owner for #149; this item owns canonical alias/function/indirect spawning repair. Plan: executable safe stubs prove real argv and audit refusal, then mutation restores only prior implementation to prove regression detection. Companion: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10. No workflow execution or publication authorized."
  "2026-10-10T02:53:26.293Z",codex-sol,"Focused real-subprocess corpus passes 26/26 with zero skips. npm/Bun artifact acceptance is running. Both linked PM tests pass (26/26 indirection, 1/1 pack/install), but project test-result-tracking is disabled, so explicit comments hold the receipts. No tracking policy changed. Existing release-workflow audit passes with one recognized provenance invocation. New opaque argument and executable paths are refused even with a literal flag; plain scalar/array flags and fully literal function bodies remain accepted."
  "2026-10-10T03:02:44.248Z",codex-sol,"Fail-on-revert proof at base fedeb7bf19241fa2e9ce3ae9d263bc1e091729a4: restoring only attestation.ts made the 26-test corpus fail 18 cases (8 still pass). All repaired bytes restored. Real npm config get confirms --provenance followed by --no-provenance yields false, reverse order true. Both npm and native Bun packed consumers pass actual SDK activation and built auditor checks. No registry publication occurred."
  "2026-10-10T03:14:32.322Z",codex-sol,"Precision follow-up: the full gate caught a quoted case-arm pattern being counted as an extra opaque executable. The guard now retains unresolved evidence specifically at quoted executable scalar references before expansion, preserving word boundaries without treating whitespace in a case label as a command. The original exact-count case-arm regression and all 128 focused attestation tests pass unchanged; braced and unknown executable references are covered. No existing assertions were weakened."
  "2026-10-10T03:21:01.223Z",codex-sol,"Final source release:check passes 496 tests with zero failures and two existing opt-in skips; four-dimensional coverage 100% across 23 files. Focused attestation set passes 128/128 with no skips. New combined real-subprocess and pack regressions pass 27/27. Fail-on-revert restores only base attestation.ts and fails 18/26 cases; all repaired bytes restored. Final packed Node/npm and native Bun auditor and SDK activation pass. No live publish command executed. Full evidence and limits: docs/publication-repair.md."
  "2026-10-10T03:23:46.867Z",codex-sol,"Review candidate: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/152, implementation c73e0effbff8c4c493f49e3fa15c5c7208b4f151. Claim released; item remains unclosed pending orchestrator verification. Full gate, corpus, packed acceptance and independent revert proof are documented."
  "2026-10-10T03:57:24.045Z",codex-sol,"Orchestrator review corrections verified: first unresolved-publication diagnostic, clean-checkout packed parent creation, and current SDK9 actual_result. TDD old diagnostic and absent coverage directory each fail; repaired focused129/129 and fresh packed npm/native Bun pass. Full release:check passes496 tests with2 pre-existing opt-in skips and four100 across23configured sources. docs/publication-repair.md distinguishes PR152 from independent PR150; no merge or release."
